        "node_id": "n_5_224f7f",
        "thought_text": "Pre-process the input into two hash maps: one mapping x-coordinates to a list of y-coordinates, and another mapping y-coordinates to a list of x-coordinates. For each point, look up the sizes of these lists to calculate the product directly, avoiding the overhead of building sets during the main loop.",
