        "node_id": "n_6_280268",
        "thought_text": "Sort the points by x-coordinate and then by y-coordinate. Use a sliding window or two-pointer approach to efficiently count points with matching coordinates, though this adds complexity compared to the hash map approach and may not offer significant performance gains given the constraints.",
