        "node_id": "n_7_8ff995",
        "thought_text": "Use a hash map (dictionary) to store the count of points for each x-coordinate and each y-coordinate. Iterate through every point, treating it as the right-angle vertex, and multiply the count of points sharing its x-coordinate by the count of points sharing its y-coordinate, then subtract 1 for the point itself to get the number of valid pairs forming legs.",
