        "thought_text": "Sort the points by x-coordinate and then by y-coordinate. Iterate through the sorted list and use binary search or two pointers to find points with matching coordinates, though this approach is likely less efficient ($O(N^2)$ or $O(N^2 \\log N)$) compared to the hash map method given the constraints.",
